Package: horroR
Title: Horror Movie Color Palettes and Themes for Data Visualization
Description: A comprehensive collection of color palettes inspired by horror movies,
    along with ggplot2 themes and special effects to create atmospheric,
    creepy data visualizations. Includes 30+ movie-inspired palettes (The Shining,
    Suspiria, Get Out, Hereditary, etc.), 10 mood-based palettes (blood, ghostly,
    demonic, etc.), 9 horror-themed ggplot2 themes, and special effects like
    blood drips, fog, scratches, and glitch effects.
Date: 2024-12-28
Version: 0.4.0.9000
